            "description": {
              "content": "Create a new Recinto in the system. The parameters are:\n\n- name: Recinto name\n- code: Recinto code\n- location_id: ID of the Recinto location (you can check the endpoint GET /locations)\n- address_name: Street name of the Recinto\n- address_number: Street number of the Recinto \n- address_optional: Address description (OPTIONAL)\n- latitude: Latitude of the Recinto (OPTIONAL)\n- longitude: Longitude of the Recinto (OPTIONAL)\n- postcode: Recinto Zip Code (OPTIONAL)\n- establishment_code: Recinto Code (OPTIONAL)\n\n**Permisos requeridos para utilizar este endpoint:** \n* Attendance permissions en: 'Lectura y Modificación'.\n",
